; @utic/* — the shared acceptance framework (@utic/acceptance-core) — is published to the
; Azure Artifacts "unstructured-npm" feed; all other deps come from the public registry.
; The feed token is NEVER written to disk: the _authToken line below interpolates it from the
; AZURE_ARTIFACTS_TOKEN environment variable at install time. Export it locally from an Azure
; DevOps token (you must be `az login`'d):
;   export AZURE_ARTIFACTS_TOKEN=$(az account get-access-token \
;     --resource 499b84ac-1321-427f-aa17-267ca6975798 --query accessToken -o tsv)
; The --resource GUID is required — a plain `az account get-access-token` is ARM-scoped and the
; feed rejects it. In CI, export the same var from the OIDC-minted feed token.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
@utic:registry=https://pkgs.dev.azure.com/unstructured/_packaging/unstructured-npm/npm/registry/
//pkgs.dev.azure.com/unstructured/_packaging/unstructured-npm/npm/registry/:_authToken=${AZURE_ARTIFACTS_TOKEN}
